{"id":"62a32ca4e63fca90","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-identity-free-program-calculus.md","title":"df identity free program calculus","display":"df identity free program calculus","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-identity-free-program-calculus","aliases":["72-df-identity-free-program-calculus"],"display":"df identity free program calculus","depends_on":["[[72-df-logic-program-syntax]]","[[72-df-program-definition-form]]","[[72-df-clark-equational-theory]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX §4.1 and Definitions4.1.1,4.2.1, print655–658/PDF667–670; explicit finite-stage encoding","verification_status":"source-rules-and-definition-checked; explicit closure encoding checked","proof_status":"definition-well-defined by recursion on finite proof height","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-identity-free-program-calculus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-identity-free-program-calculus</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df identity free program calculus"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"26e8ed17356e430c\" href=\"?note=26e8ed17356e430c\" title=\"72-df-logic-program-syntax\">72-df-logic-program-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9586f246c1c6084\" href=\"?note=d9586f246c1c6084\" title=\"72-df-program-definition-form\">72-df-program-definition-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2d49b9fae2b96976\" href=\"?note=2d49b9fae2b96976\" title=\"72-df-clark-equational-theory\">72-df-clark-equational-theory</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX §4.1 and Definitions4.1.1,4.2.1, print655–658/PDF667–670; explicit finite-stage encoding"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-rules-and-definition-checked; explicit closure encoding checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined by recursion on finite proof height"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathsf{Program}_\\Sigma\">\\(P\\in\\mathsf{Program}_\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AtLP}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{AtLP}_\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(V=\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim\">\\(\\sim\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"26e8ed17356e430c\" href=\"?note=26e8ed17356e430c\" title=\"72-df-logic-program-syntax\">72-df-logic-program-syntax</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_R^P\">\\(D_R^P\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9586f246c1c6084\" href=\"?note=d9586f246c1c6084\" title=\"72-df-program-definition-form\">72-df-program-definition-form</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{EqList}_\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Unif}_\\Sigma,\\operatorname{MGU}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{EqList}_\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Unif}_\\Sigma,\\operatorname{MGU}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 与同时项代换如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2d49b9fae2b96976\" href=\"?note=2d49b9fae2b96976\" title=\"72-df-clark-equational-theory\">72-df-clark-equational-theory</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,n\\in\\omega\">\\(r,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 的元素为有限公式集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,A\">\\(\\Gamma,A\\)</span> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\}\">\\(\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\}\\)</span>。规则编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\vec\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\vec\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle\\)</span> 的第一分量为有限前提序列、第二分量为结论；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\Gamma)\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是前提集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[t/x]\">\\(A[t/x]\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)\\)</span> 下取 core 自由代入；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_R^P(\\vec t)\">\\(D_R^P(\\vec t)\\)</span> 直接取其定义中的固定枚举与最小新鲜变量算法所得公式，不另选择任意的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 代表。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rn}_{LP}\">\\(\\operatorname{rn}_{LP}\\)</span> 将正负字面量都计为秩 0；它不是将负字面量计为额外否定构造的 core 秩。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_{P,r}^{n}\">\\(\\mathcal B_{P,r}^{n}\\)</span> 是有高度界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>、切公式秩严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 的推导集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash^-\">\\(\\vdash^-\\)</span> 的上标负号标识 identity-free 推导，不是对象语言否定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma:|\\Gamma|&lt;\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(\\Gamma)&amp;:=\\bigcup_{A\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{rn}_{LP}(B)&amp;:=0\\quad(B\\in\\mathsf{AtLP}_\\Sigma),\\\\\n\\operatorname{rn}_{LP}(A\\circ B)&amp;:=1+\\max(\\operatorname{rn}_{LP}(A),\\operatorname{rn}_{LP}(B))\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{rn}_{LP}(QxA)&amp;:=1+\\operatorname{rn}_{LP}(A)\\quad(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{NegEq}_{LP}(E)&amp;:=\\{a_i\\ne b_i:i&lt;n\\}\\quad(E=\\langle(a_i,b_i):i&lt;n\\rangle),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ax}^{-}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\top\\}:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\Gamma\\cup\\mathsf{NegEq}_{LP}(E):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma,\\ E\\in\\mathsf{EqList}_\\Sigma,\\ \\mathsf{Unif}_\\Sigma(E)=\\varnothing\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\Gamma\\cup\\mathsf{NegEq}_{LP}(E)\\cup\\{c\\doteq d\\}:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma,\\ E\\in\\mathsf{EqList}_\\Sigma,\\ c,d\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma),\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\ (\\operatorname{MGU}_\\Sigma(E,\\theta)\\land c\\theta=d\\theta)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma:|\\Gamma|&lt;\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(\\Gamma)&amp;:=\\bigcup_{A\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{rn}_{LP}(B)&amp;:=0\\quad(B\\in\\mathsf{AtLP}_\\Sigma),\\\\\n\\operatorname{rn}_{LP}(A\\circ B)&amp;:=1+\\max(\\operatorname{rn}_{LP}(A),\\operatorname{rn}_{LP}(B))\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{rn}_{LP}(QxA)&amp;:=1+\\operatorname{rn}_{LP}(A)\\quad(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{NegEq}_{LP}(E)&amp;:=\\{a_i\\ne b_i:i&lt;n\\}\\quad(E=\\langle(a_i,b_i):i&lt;n\\rangle),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ax}^{-}_\\Sigma&amp;:=\\{\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\top\\}:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\Gamma\\cup\\mathsf{NegEq}_{LP}(E):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma,\\ E\\in\\mathsf{EqList}_\\Sigma,\\ \\mathsf{Unif}_\\Sigma(E)=\\varnothing\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\Gamma\\cup\\mathsf{NegEq}_{LP}(E)\\cup\\{c\\doteq d\\}:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma,\\ E\\in\\mathsf{EqList}_\\Sigma,\\ c,d\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma),\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\ (\\operatorname{MGU}_\\Sigma(E,\\theta)\\land c\\theta=d\\theta)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Rules}_{P,r}&amp;:=\n\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\lor B\\}\\rangle:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma,\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{B\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\lor B\\}\\rangle:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma,\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\},\\Gamma\\cup\\{B\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\land B\\}\\rangle:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma,\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{A[t/x]\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\exists xA\\}\\rangle:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma,\\ A\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma,\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}x\\in V,\\ t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma),\\ \\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{A[u/x]\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\forall xA\\}\\rangle:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma,\\ A\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma,\\ x,u\\in V,\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}u\\ne x,\\ u\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(\\Gamma)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(\\forall xA),\\ \\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(u,x,A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\},\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\sim A\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\rangle:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma,\\ A\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma,\\ \\operatorname{rn}_{LP}(A)&lt;r\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{D_R^P(\\vec t)\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\{R(\\vec t)\\}\\rangle:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma,\\ R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel},\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^{a_R(R)}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\sim D_R^P(\\vec t)\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\overline R(\\vec t)\\}\\rangle:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma,\\ R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel},\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^{a_R(R)}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Rules}_{P,r}&amp;:=\n\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\lor B\\}\\rangle:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma,\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{B\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\lor B\\}\\rangle:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma,\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\},\\Gamma\\cup\\{B\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\land B\\}\\rangle:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma,\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{A[t/x]\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\exists xA\\}\\rangle:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma,\\ A\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma,\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}x\\in V,\\ t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma),\\ \\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{A[u/x]\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\forall xA\\}\\rangle:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma,\\ A\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma,\\ x,u\\in V,\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}u\\ne x,\\ u\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{LP}(\\Gamma)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(\\forall xA),\\ \\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(u,x,A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\},\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\sim A\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\rangle:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma,\\ A\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma,\\ \\operatorname{rn}_{LP}(A)&lt;r\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{D_R^P(\\vec t)\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\{R(\\vec t)\\}\\rangle:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma,\\ R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel},\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^{a_R(R)}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\sim D_R^P(\\vec t)\\}\\rangle,\\Gamma\\cup\\{\\overline R(\\vec t)\\}\\rangle:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma,\\ R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel},\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^{a_R(R)}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal B_{P,r}^{0}&amp;:=\\mathsf{Ax}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\\\\n\\mathcal B_{P,r}^{n+1}&amp;:=\\mathcal B_{P,r}^{n}\\cup\\{\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma:\\exists\\vec\\Gamma\\ (\\langle\\vec\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Rules}_{P,r}\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\Gamma)\\subseteq\\mathcal B_{P,r}^{n})\\},\\\\\nP\\vdash^{-n}_{r}\\Gamma&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal B_{P,r}^{n},\\\\\nP\\vdash^{-}_{r}\\Gamma&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ (P\\vdash^{-n}_{r}\\Gamma),\\\\\nP\\vdash^{-}\\Gamma&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists r\\in\\omega\\ (P\\vdash^{-}_{r}\\Gamma).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal B_{P,r}^{0}&amp;:=\\mathsf{Ax}^{-}_\\Sigma,\\\\\n\\mathcal B_{P,r}^{n+1}&amp;:=\\mathcal B_{P,r}^{n}\\cup\\{\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_\\Sigma:\\exists\\vec\\Gamma\\ (\\langle\\vec\\Gamma,\\Delta\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{Rules}_{P,r}\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\Gamma)\\subseteq\\mathcal B_{P,r}^{n})\\},\\\\\nP\\vdash^{-n}_{r}\\Gamma&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal B_{P,r}^{n},\\\\\nP\\vdash^{-}_{r}\\Gamma&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ (P\\vdash^{-n}_{r}\\Gamma),\\\\\nP\\vdash^{-}\\Gamma&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists r\\in\\omega\\ (P\\vdash^{-}_{r}\\Gamma).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R(P)\\Vdash_r^n\\Gamma\">\\(\\mathcal R(P)\\Vdash_r^n\\Gamma\\)</span>；这里写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\vdash_r^{-n}\\Gamma\">\\(P\\vdash_r^{-n}\\Gamma\\)</span>，并显式编码有限高度闭包。PDF668 页图逐项核对了 E1/E2、五个逻辑规则、cut 与两个 program rule；PDF670 核对 identity-free 的递归。唯一删去的是关系或任意原子公式的 identity 公理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\sim A,A\">\\(\\Gamma,\\sim A,A\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\top\">\\(\\Gamma,\\top\\)</span> 与等式公理保留。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r=0\">\\(r=0\\)</span> 时没有 cut 规则。</p>\n<p>有限语法树递归给秩和自由变量；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的自然数递归给每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_{P,r}^{n}\">\\(\\mathcal B_{P,r}^{n}\\)</span> 唯一集合。每个非公理规则只使用更小高度的前提，等价于源书每个前提高度严格小于结论界的写法。全称规则保留 eigenvariable 的新鲜条件；program rule 的定义式可以比结论字面量秩高，所以不能直接套用普通一阶 cut 的秩下降论证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-logic-program-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"26e8ed17356e430c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-logic-program-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-program-definition-form","status":"resolved","id":"d9586f246c1c6084","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-program-definition-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-clark-equational-theory","status":"resolved","id":"2d49b9fae2b96976","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-clark-equational-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-logic-program-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"26e8ed17356e430c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathsf{Program}_\\Sigma$、$\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma$、$\\mathsf{AtLP}_\\Sigma$、$\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)